{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0604_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d75fca57fdb81d45447da058a2d43906959c62dbadb904f873a4ae1d64763cd3", "ja": "（このみさんが考えた服のポスター撮影が終了した。\nワイナリー併設のレストランで、軽めのお疲れ様会だ）", "zh": "（木实小姐设计的服装海报拍摄结束了。现在正在附设酒庄的餐厅里，举行一个简单的慰劳会）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0604_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "d9e1141ff7f069d495b5003726c26add7dbe24c018b56251a192e8b16244dece", "ja": "じゃあ、赤ワイン2つと、チーズの盛り合わせ。\nあとは、このサラダもお願いしようかしら。", "zh": "那么来一杯红葡萄酒2，再来一份芝士拼盘。还有，这份沙拉也一起点了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0604_1002_tenin", "source_sha256": "98c6114d06e87339bbc3daa2f5cefeca780e7d73feef91f3e131c868011332c3", "ja": "かしこまりました、少々お待ちください。", "zh": "明白了，请稍等。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0604_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "86e7815d11e3f944f947c65eaff181c29f84273c4639ebeb090061880cfe1be5", "ja": "……ね、ねえ、{$P$}。\n私の気のせいじゃないわよね？", "zh": "……呐、呐，{$P$}。\n应该不是我的心理作用吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0604_1004_p", "source_sha256": "777adfc4f5489673cac93651e88f146ae4139aa20aab4cb3c1bacadb8a79397d", "ja": "え？　このみさん、どうかしたんですか？\nそんなに震えて……。", "zh": "咦？这个美奈子……呃，这位小姐，您怎么了？\n怎么抖得这么厉害……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0604_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "97200d98522f9fdf609ac14507eeba2ceab087ce24dfa61e3913dc38e02ff413", "ja": "さっきの店員さんよ！　私がワインを注文してたのに！\n年齢確認とか、全然されなかったわよね！？", "zh": "是刚才那位店员！明明是我点了葡萄酒的！结果根本没确认年龄吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0604_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "8a999440ada51823f5e68afd20d20f5e090354ce183b08cb25559b22b72d375c", "ja": "絶対に聞かれると思って、\n免許証を見せる準備までしてたのに！", "zh": "我还以为肯定会被问，所以连驾照都准备好要拿出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0604_1007_p", "source_sha256": "1f9430be2c275497300ce13a71f905b929b3c08f2fa154adcbfb6839117f27f0", "ja": "た、確かに何もなかったですね。あまりにも自然で、\nこのみさんに言われるまで気づきませんでした。", "zh": "确、确实什么都没有呢。实在是太自然了，要不是木实小姐说起，我都没注意到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0604_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "3f320c6754c7a3ef0e3be165cb63d9c41254842bf45ca94816e23013fb91f7d7", "ja": "そ、そうよね……。\nこれってやっぱり、アダルティな服のおかげかしら？", "zh": "确、确实是这样呢……  \n这果然是多亏了这身成熟风的衣服吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0604_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "6b45293a4b0b12009430b6113ac2d2521964577f6ed80005b1f19a669a89405e", "ja": "撮影のときも大人っぽいって褒めてもらったけど、\nまさか年齢確認すらされないだなんて……ふふっ♪", "zh": "拍摄时也有人夸我很有成熟气质，  \n没想到竟然连年龄确认都不用做……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0604_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "ae4b9d98c76b730b4709d60e7b1c853ec53516ba9f88e5e82c78a7206fdb4f83", "ja": "年齢を確認されないってだけで、こんなに嬉しいのね。\nうふふっ。ニヤニヤが止まらないわ♪", "zh": "只是没被查年龄而已，就能让人这么开心呢。\n呵呵呵，我嘴角都快合不拢了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0604_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c33912a8a2962891795ed9bc4588963b8ab155f7beb88e82be5f53bebfdb1791", "ja": "良かったですね。その服に込めた\nこのみさんの思いが、証明されたってことです。", "zh": "那就太好了。这说明好美小姐倾注在那件衣服上的心意得到了证明。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0604_1012_p", "source_sha256": "68f4d20e6776cca8e5b684f41454f049d574d92c2837038ea55d55d86a5f042c", "ja": "アダルティに見える服なら、\nこれからも免許証を出す回数が減るかもしれませんよ。", "zh": "如果穿上看起来成熟的服装，以后也许就能少出示几次身份证了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0604_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "ed21d1cabb94b95d04fbc05d6482aa005c83f275926b92234766ef4ea6d26037", "ja": "そうなってくれたら、すごくありがたいわ。\n飲みに行く度に説明するのは大変だから。でも……。", "zh": "要是能那样的话，可真是帮大忙了。\n每次去喝酒都要解释，实在太麻烦了。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0604_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "e76d7622540babadc97f3655dfea81c21806d1e0b61f873f7b49a07e0c811a9f", "ja": "だからこそ、\nこの服に頼りすぎちゃダメだとも思うのよね。", "zh": "正因为如此，\n我也觉得不能太过依赖这身服装呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0604_1015_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0604_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "78d3389176536f06c3ad6f2101155d914f1c9fb010f00a19ae837a70d61361ec", "ja": "だって、今日は服が大人っぽかっただけで、\n私自身が大人に見られたわけじゃないでしょう？", "zh": "因为，今天只是衣服看起来比较成熟，  \n并不是我本人被当成大人了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0604_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "71a899a76a938c19f6bf6c023653a6228325e2291a9ea4150a784026ad7bf6e8", "ja": "見た目だけじゃない。中身も含めた全部で、\n私が大人なんだって証明しないとね♪", "zh": "不只是外表。包括内在在内，我得用全部来证明自己是大人才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0604_1018_p", "source_sha256": "a69a9d7d6c2109087fc4e03c97093b10902d4b11d1e249b7d1d5458c4117b20d", "ja": "そうですね……。\nとてもこのみさんらしいと思います！", "zh": "是啊……\n我觉得非常有小此木小姐的风格！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0604_1019_039kon", "source_sha256": "8e9a9d64b792bcd12693b1afdf37580fd765fd2fede71b967f04af5c7c42cc2f", "ja": "うふふ♪　今日はそのための第一歩ってところね。\nあのポスターで、大人の魅力を再認識してもらうわよ！", "zh": "呵呵♪　今天就当是为此迈出的第一步吧。\n我要用那张海报，让他们重新见识一下成熟大人的魅力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0604_1020_tenin", "source_sha256": "052b8e425516a4de75818968573e17664f86c6087178ecd895ae9ed2623e1ac2", "ja": "お待たせしました～、赤ワインになりま～す。", "zh": "久等了～，您的红葡萄酒来了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0604_1021_039kon", "source_sha256": "30bae9018d38bdcbc6acd1a0e052f0893532d971a91b9af0ac8f9f78dd42caba", "ja": "待ってました～！　それじゃ乾杯しましょう。\nアダルティなこの服と、それを作った私に……ねっ♪", "zh": "等好久啦～！那我们干杯吧。\n敬成熟优雅的这身衣服，还有做出它的我……来♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
